I say I can live alone, even if loneliness burns me.

13
00:00:28,130 --> 00:00:34,010
unubore no morosa wo kimi wa shitte ita no ni

14
00:00:28,130 --> 00:00:34,010
Even though you knew how fragile my pride was.

15
00:00:34,010 --> 00:00:40,600
kokoro made uchinomesareta kono yoru ni

16
00:00:34,010 --> 00:00:40,600
Tonight, even my heart is shattered.

17
00:00:40,600 --> 00:00:44,600
kimi no koe sagasu

18
00:00:40,600 --> 00:00:44,600
I hate being helpless.

19
00:00:44,600 --> 00:00:49,110
kono yowasa ga nikui yo

20
00:00:44,600 --> 00:00:49,110
The longing for your voice.

21
00:00:49,110 --> 00:00:54,700
ima sugu torimodoshi ni ikanakya

22
00:00:49,110 --> 00:00:54,700
"I have to go back right away!"

23
00:00:54,700 --> 00:00:56,240
baka darou?

24
00:00:54,700 --> 00:00:56,240
I'm stupid, aren't I?

25
00:00:56,240 --> 00:00:57,450
ai

26
00:00:56,240 --> 00:00:57,450
Love!

27
00:00:57,450 --> 00:01:00,950
kizudarake no ai wo shinjite

28
00:00:57,450 --> 00:01:00,950
Believing in my wounded love...

29
00:01:00,950 --> 00:01:10,840
nagareochita namida sae mo tsuyosa e to kaete

30
00:01:00,950 --> 00:01:10,840
I will turn these fallen tears into strength.

31
00:01:10,840 --> 00:01:11,670
ai

32
00:01:10,840 --> 00:01:11,670
Love!

33
00:01:11,670 --> 00:01:15,470
kizudarake no ai da to shite mo

34
00:01:11,670 --> 00:01:15,470
Even though it's a wounded love,

35
00:01:15,470 --> 00:01:19,470
bokura no sekai wo tomoshiteru

36
00:01:15,470 --> 00:01:19,470
it illuminates my world.

37
00:01:19,470 --> 00:01:25,730
kono ai mou ichibyou taritomo

38
00:01:19,470 --> 00:01:25,730
Even for a moment,

39
00:01:25,730 --> 00:01:28,560
hanasanai

40
00:01:25,730 --> 00:01:28,560
I won't let this love go!

41
00:01:29,980 --> 00:01:32,400
Another painkiller injection?!

42
00:01:29,980 --> 00:01:32,400
INFIRMARY

43
00:01:30,070 --> 00:01:34,570
EPISODE 49:
THE TIGER AND TSUBASA'S FIERY SPIRIT

44
00:01:32,400 --> 00:01:33,900
You're an idiot!

45
00:01:34,690 --> 00:01:37,050
Doctor, please, I beg you!

46
00:01:37,050 --> 00:01:39,410
In this condition, Nankatsu will lose.

47
00:01:39,410 --> 00:01:41,490
Why do you keep being so stubborn?

48
00:01:41,490 --> 00:01:43,330
You've done enough so far, haven't you?

49
00:01:43,330 --> 00:01:46,760
Second place is a pretty good result, after all.

50
00:01:46,760 --> 00:01:49,330
If you stop and think about your future football career,

51
00:01:49,330 --> 00:01:52,650
a middle school tournament is quite trivial.

52
00:01:52,650 --> 00:01:55,110
If you push yourself too hard in this match,

53
00:01:55,110 --> 00:01:57,590
and can't play football again...

54
00:01:57,590 --> 00:01:59,850
Won't you regret it later?

55
00:02:01,120 --> 00:02:02,110
Dream...

56
00:02:03,010 --> 00:02:03,970
This is my dream.

57
00:02:04,980 --> 00:02:08,770
It might seem trivial to you, but this is my dream.

58
00:02:08,770 --> 00:02:11,500
In this tournament with my friends at Nankatsu,

59
00:02:11,500 --> 00:02:14,230
I swore to achieve the 3rd championship.

60
00:02:14,230 --> 00:02:16,740
This is our dream!

61
00:02:17,430 --> 00:02:18,980
Tsubasa...

62
00:02:18,980 --> 00:02:22,990
If I can't achieve this, what was the reason I stayed in Japan?

63
00:02:23,440 --> 00:02:25,500
To make up for not being able to go to Brazil,

64
00:02:26,080 --> 00:02:29,120
I decided to win three consecutive victories with the friends

65
00:02:29,120 --> 00:02:31,420
who have been playing with me all this time.

66
00:02:31,420 --> 00:02:34,920
I worked hard to make a single goal a reality.

67
00:02:34,920 --> 00:02:37,970
Another pass was sent to Hyuga-kun.

68
00:02:37,970 --> 00:02:39,720
Eat this, Nankatsu!

69
00:02:39,720 --> 00:02:43,510
There it is! Hyuga-kun's sixth Tiger Shot today!

70
00:02:39,720 --> 00:02:43,510
Tiger Shot

71
00:02:43,510 --> 00:02:47,520
We can't concede more goals while Tsubasa isn't here!

72
00:02:47,520 --> 00:02:49,160
The Tiger Shot is going straight!

73
00:02:47,520 --> 00:02:49,160
Tiger Shot

74
00:02:49,160 --> 00:02:51,270
Just face it, it has to work somehow!

75
00:02:55,400 --> 00:02:56,150
Ishizaki!

76
00:02:56,150 --> 00:02:59,240
Ah, the ball lodged in Ishizaki-kun's gut!

77
00:03:02,120 --> 00:03:06,410
Without pause, Hyuga-kun prepared for another Tiger Shot!

78
00:03:02,120 --> 00:03:06,410
Tiger Shot

79
00:03:10,120 --> 00:03:13,130
This time, Takasugi-kun blocked it with his chest!

80
00:03:15,750 --> 00:03:17,110
Eat this!

81
00:03:18,970 --> 00:03:22,340
I'll take a third...!

82
00:03:23,050 --> 00:03:23,850
What?!

83
00:03:23,850 --> 00:03:27,100
This whistle marks the end of the first half!

84
00:03:27,100 --> 00:03:30,600
Nankatsu managed to hold Toho's Wild Tiger!

85
00:03:30,600 --> 00:03:32,350
We survived...

86
00:03:32,350 --> 00:03:34,140
The score in the first half is 3-2.

87
00:03:34,140 --> 00:03:36,860
This half ended with Toho leading by one goal.

88
00:03:36,860 --> 00:03:40,360
Damn it! If we had one more second, we would have gotten a two-goal lead!

89
00:03:41,500 --> 00:03:43,110
Are you two okay?

90
00:03:43,110 --> 00:03:44,120
Yes!

91
00:03:44,120 --> 00:03:47,370
Good fight! Ishizaki! Takasugi!

92
00:03:47,370 --> 00:03:50,510
I'll pay you back in the second half, Nankatsu!

93
00:03:51,890 --> 00:03:55,000
The sun will be my ally!

94
00:03:55,000 --> 00:03:57,280
They'll get tired after playing so much in this heat.

95
00:03:57,280 --> 00:03:59,880
Fatigue will catch up to them in the second half.

96
00:03:59,880 --> 00:04:02,400
As for me, I underwent special training

97
00:04:02,400 --> 00:04:05,100
under the scorching sun of Okinawa.

98
00:04:05,100 --> 00:04:07,730
I'll grind them to dust until the end of the second half!

99
00:04:07,730 --> 00:04:09,330
I'll score 10 goals and show everyone,

100
00:04:09,330 --> 00:04:13,900
I would win even if Tsubasa were here!

101
00:04:15,590 --> 00:04:16,940
Tsubasa!

102
00:04:16,940 --> 00:04:18,880
Are you okay, Tsubasa-kun?

103
00:04:18,880 --> 00:04:21,070
I'm fine. What about the match?

104
00:04:21,070 --> 00:04:22,960
Still 3-2.

105
00:04:22,960 --> 00:04:24,960
To stop Hyuga-san's Tiger Shot,

106
00:04:24,960 --> 00:04:28,830
Ishizaki-senpai and Takasugi-senpai used their bodies.

107
00:04:28,830 --> 00:04:31,610
It wasn't as big a deal as I thought.

108
00:04:28,830 --> 00:04:34,210
INFIRMARY

109
00:04:31,610 --> 00:04:34,210
So you kept them to just one goal, huh?

110
00:04:34,210 --> 00:04:36,840
Well, will you be able to play in the second half?

111
00:04:36,840 --> 00:04:41,550
Yes. It's been re-bandaged and I got a painkiller injection.

112
00:04:41,550 --> 00:04:44,300
I can fight at full power for another 30 minutes!

113
00:04:44,300 --> 00:04:45,860
Really, Tsubasa?

114
00:04:45,860 --> 00:04:46,700
Great!

115
00:04:46,700 --> 00:04:47,880
However,

116
00:04:48,300 --> 00:04:51,070
if you collapse to the ground again,

117
00:04:51,070 --> 00:04:54,190
when that happens, your time on the field will be over, Tsubasa.

118
00:04:54,790 --> 00:04:56,730
Okay. Understood.

119
00:04:56,730 --> 00:04:58,700
Alright! Let's do this!

120
00:04:58,700 --> 00:05:01,220
As Japan's champions,

121
00:05:01,220 --> 00:05:03,740
our dream of winning the 3rd victory is not lost yet!

122
00:05:03,740 --> 00:05:05,410
Watch us, Toho!

123
00:05:05,410 --> 00:05:07,620
We'll definitely turn it around in the next half!

124
00:05:07,620 --> 00:05:09,200
YES!

125
00:05:09,200 --> 00:05:10,870
TOHO ACADEMY - TOKYO

126
00:05:10,870 --> 00:05:13,550
Wakashimazu, are you okay?

127
00:05:14,250 --> 00:05:17,450
I'm fine, Captain. No need to worry.

128
00:05:17,450 --> 00:05:20,880
No matter what, I will continue to protect Toho's goal.

129
00:05:21,310 --> 00:05:24,130
No matter what... I swear it!

130
00:05:30,360 --> 00:05:31,700
Father,

131
00:05:31,700 --> 00:05:34,270
my answer won't change.

132
00:05:34,270 --> 00:05:38,770
WAKADORYU KARATE DOJO

133
00:05:34,270 --> 00:05:38,770
I have no intention of taking over the Dojo or the Wakadoryu school.

134
00:05:38,770 --> 00:05:40,640
I know all about your dream.

135
00:05:40,640 --> 00:05:44,030
But you haven't succeeded in the last two years.

136
00:05:44,420 --> 00:05:46,250
Think about it, Ken.

137
00:05:46,250 --> 00:05:50,010
You are more suited for karate than football.

138
00:05:50,010 --> 00:05:51,300
I understand.

139
00:05:52,540 --> 00:05:56,280
If you insist this much, if I can't become champion in the next tournament,

140
00:05:56,280 --> 00:05:57,290
I'll give up football!

141
00:05:57,900 --> 00:06:00,920
I hope you won't go back on your word, Ken.

142
00:06:00,920 --> 00:06:01,910
I promise.

143
00:06:01,910 --> 00:06:04,100
But we, Toho, will definitely win.

144
00:06:04,100 --> 00:06:05,960
We will be victorious.

145
00:06:05,960 --> 00:06:09,890
And from that moment on, I will continue being a goalkeeper and playing football!

146
00:06:15,410 --> 00:06:17,140
Good job, everyone!

147
00:06:17,140 --> 00:06:19,330
Even though Tsubasa scored two goals,

148
00:06:19,330 --> 00:06:21,530
the game is completely going at our pace.

149
00:06:21,530 --> 00:06:24,830
Keep sending the ball to Hyuga in the second half too!

150
00:06:24,830 --> 00:06:25,320
What—

151
00:06:25,320 --> 00:06:28,450
If you do that, we will definitely win the match!

152
00:06:28,450 --> 00:06:29,820
Coach!

153
00:06:29,820 --> 00:06:32,660
Our coach accepted Hyuga-san!

154
00:06:32,660 --> 00:06:34,900
Alright! Let's go wild in the second half!

155
00:06:34,900 --> 00:06:37,160
Let's achieve "Toho's First Victory"!

156
00:06:37,160 --> 00:06:38,360
Yes!

157
00:06:39,970 --> 00:06:43,920
Toho has truly become one right now.

158
00:06:47,420 --> 00:06:49,760
You're Misugi-kun from Musashi Middle School, aren't you?

159
00:06:50,470 --> 00:06:54,690
I'm Katagiri from the National Japanese Football Federation.

160
00:06:54,690 --> 00:06:57,990
I believe you already know that after this tournament, for the Europe tour,

161
00:06:57,990 --> 00:07:01,290
a selection team will be formed.

162
00:07:01,290 --> 00:07:02,030
Yes, I know.

163
00:07:02,030 --> 00:07:05,650
I want you to join the selection team's training camp.

164
00:07:05,650 --> 00:07:07,110
What? Me?

165
00:07:07,110 --> 00:07:10,080
However, not as a player, but as a coach!

166
00:07:10,080 --> 00:07:10,980
Coach...?!

167
00:07:10,980 --> 00:07:14,160
I admit you are an incredibly talented player.

168
00:07:14,160 --> 00:07:16,160
However, you have a heart condition.

169
00:07:18,870 --> 00:07:23,170
Nevertheless, not only is your understanding of football incredible,

170
00:07:23,170 --> 00:07:26,280
you are also masterful at calmly observing those around you.

171
00:07:26,280 --> 00:07:30,210
I want you to join the camp as a coach, to help every player enhance their strengths,

172
00:07:30,210 --> 00:07:32,780
and overcome their deficiencies.

173
00:07:32,780 --> 00:07:36,350
Coaching... Can I really do that?

174
00:07:36,350 --> 00:07:37,930
Please think about it.

175
00:07:44,950 --> 00:07:46,150
Tsubasa-kun is here!

176
00:07:46,150 --> 00:07:49,030
He's come out to play in the second half and looks good!

177
00:07:49,030 --> 00:07:52,030
So you're going to play after all, Tsubasa.

178
00:07:52,030 --> 00:07:54,450
Now it will be worth playing!

179
00:07:54,450 --> 00:07:55,620
You're right!

180
00:07:55,620 --> 00:07:57,240
Everyone...

181
00:07:57,240 --> 00:07:59,240
WAKADORYU KARATE DOJO

182
00:07:59,240 --> 00:08:01,910
Both teams are taking their positions.

183
00:08:02,360 --> 00:08:03,500
Ken...

184
00:08:03,500 --> 00:08:05,860
In the first half, it was a showdown between Tsubasa-kun's Drive Shot

185
00:08:03,500 --> 00:08:05,860
Drive Shot: Diving Shot, Eagle Shot

186
00:08:05,860 --> 00:08:08,250
and Hyuga-kun's Tiger Shot.

187
00:08:05,860 --> 00:08:08,250
Tiger Shot

188
00:08:08,250 --> 00:08:11,380
What developments await us in the second half?

189
00:08:11,380 --> 00:08:14,010
Come on! The 30 minutes of the second half!

190
00:08:14,010 --> 00:08:16,140
My final middle school match.

191
00:08:16,140 --> 00:08:20,140
In the next 30 minutes, I will make our dream come true!

192
00:08:21,060 --> 00:08:23,140
The second half begins!

193
00:08:23,140 --> 00:08:25,730
Go! Toho's Sliding Team!

194
00:08:25,730 --> 00:08:27,210
Okay!

195
00:08:27,210 --> 00:08:30,230
Toho tries to crush Nankatsu at the start!

196
00:08:32,030 --> 00:08:33,660
Tsubasa-kun skillfully dodged them!

197
00:08:33,660 --> 00:08:34,950
Eat this, Tsubasa!

198
00:08:35,370 --> 00:08:37,080
This time Hyuga-kun attacks!

199
00:08:37,080 --> 00:08:38,740
The Wild Tiger bares his fangs!

200
00:08:39,660 --> 00:08:42,870
However, first the Falcon spreads its wings to the sky!

201
00:08:42,870 --> 00:08:44,130
What?!

202
00:08:44,130 --> 00:08:47,170
You're supposed to be injured. How can you jump this high?

203
00:08:49,920 --> 00:08:51,830
Alright! Let's go, everyone!

204
00:08:51,830 --> 00:08:52,590
Okay!

205
00:08:52,590 --> 00:08:56,170
Nankatsu's Captain Ozora Tsubasa-kun started attacking with the momentum he gained!

206
00:08:56,170 --> 00:08:57,680
He's completely back in the game!

207
00:08:57,680 --> 00:08:59,680
Go! We're close!

208
00:09:00,930 --> 00:09:03,180
I won't let you attack quickly!

209
00:09:03,770 --> 00:09:04,390
Take this!

210
00:09:04,390 --> 00:09:07,500
Tsubasa-kun passed to Nankatsu's Silver Duo,

211
00:09:07,500 --> 00:09:10,780
Kisugi-kun and Taki-kun, who are barely beaten!

212
00:09:11,380 --> 00:09:12,110
Bad!

213
00:09:12,110 --> 00:09:13,110
Come on!

214
00:09:13,110 --> 00:09:15,890
Tsubasa is a time bomb.

215
00:09:15,890 --> 00:09:17,780
It's uncertain when he'll explode!

216
00:09:17,780 --> 00:09:20,790
While Tsubasa is still feeling good, we must score!

217
00:09:21,290 --> 00:09:23,160
Kisugi-kun goes for a header!

218
00:09:24,140 --> 00:09:24,660
Taki!

219
00:09:24,660 --> 00:09:26,830
No, it's not a shot!

220
00:09:26,830 --> 00:09:28,840
Wakashimazu-kun was completely tricked!

221
00:09:28,840 --> 00:09:29,840
Okay, go!

222
00:09:30,270 --> 00:09:34,070
Nankatsu's Silver Duo turns this pass directly into a double header!

223
00:09:34,070 --> 00:09:35,840
It's a 3D Attack!

224
00:09:35,840 --> 00:09:36,880
Wakashimazu!

225
00:09:36,880 --> 00:09:38,340
At last! We caught up!

226
00:09:39,220 --> 00:09:40,130
Damn it!

227
00:09:40,130 --> 00:09:42,260
Still, Wakashimazu-kun goes after it!

228
00:09:42,260 --> 00:09:44,520
But his punch can't reach!

229
00:09:46,020 --> 00:09:47,770
Ken! Use your fingers!

230
00:09:52,720 --> 00:09:54,150
He stopped it!

231
00:09:54,150 --> 00:09:55,030
What?!

232
00:09:55,030 --> 00:09:57,450
He stretched his arm as far as he could, spread his fingers,

233
00:09:57,450 --> 00:09:59,870
and barely managed to clear the ball!

234
00:09:59,870 --> 00:10:01,950
That's the karate knife-hand technique!

235
00:10:01,950 --> 00:10:03,770
A perfect play from Wakashimazu-kun!

236
00:10:03,770 --> 00:10:04,540
Ken!

237
00:10:04,540 --> 00:10:06,500
Nankatsu couldn't score!

238
00:10:06,500 --> 00:10:08,210
Nice save, Wakashimazu!

239
00:10:08,210 --> 00:10:09,430
D-Damn it!

240
00:10:09,430 --> 00:10:11,130
So close!

241
00:10:11,130 --> 00:10:12,550
But we still have a corner kick!

242
00:10:13,480 --> 00:10:14,960
A short corner kick!

243
00:10:15,550 --> 00:10:16,720
Hurry! Get back!

244
00:10:16,720 --> 00:10:18,380
Tsubasa-kun is also moving forward!

245
00:10:18,730 --> 00:10:19,300
Taki!

246
00:10:20,740 --> 00:10:21,430
Tsubasa!

247
00:10:21,430 --> 00:10:24,060
Taki-kun crosses into the penalty area!

248
00:10:24,810 --> 00:10:27,270
But the ball is deflected!

249
00:10:27,270 --> 00:10:28,810
Good defense!

250
00:10:31,180 --> 00:10:35,070
Tsubasa-kun uses the goal post to jump in the opposite direction!

251
00:10:35,450 --> 00:10:35,990
What?!

252
00:10:37,920 --> 00:10:40,520
He sent the ball to the opposite side!

253
00:10:40,520 --> 00:10:42,570
Wakashimazu-kun is out of position once again.

254
00:10:42,570 --> 00:10:43,330
I'll handle it!

255
00:10:45,340 --> 00:10:48,040
Here's Izawa-kun's signature move, the Five-Meter Header!

256
00:10:48,040 --> 00:10:49,330
Alright! It's a tie!

257
00:10:49,330 --> 00:10:50,250
Wakashimazu!

258
00:10:50,250 --> 00:10:51,290
Ken!

259
00:10:55,740 --> 00:10:56,930
He stopped it!

260
00:10:56,930 --> 00:10:59,720
That's Wakashimazu-kun's special Triangle Kick Defense!

261
00:10:59,720 --> 00:11:00,430
What?!

262
00:11:02,430 --> 00:11:04,760
Nankatsu attacks Toho's goal repeatedly,

263
00:11:04,760 --> 00:11:08,100
but Wakashimazu-kun completely stops their attempts!

264
00:11:08,100 --> 00:11:12,190
Their fierce struggle continues right after the start of the second half!

265
00:11:12,190 --> 00:11:15,440
Against anyone else, they would have already scored the second goal.

266
00:11:15,440 --> 00:11:19,070
As expected of the tournament's number 1 goalkeeper Wakashimazu, you know.

267
00:11:19,640 --> 00:11:22,660
Well played, Nankatsu and Tsubasa.

268
00:11:22,660 --> 00:11:27,660
However, it's better for me if Tsubasa gets up again.

269
00:11:27,660 --> 00:11:30,410
It just means he's worth beating one more time.

270
00:11:31,620 --> 00:11:34,380
Nankatsu still has a chance.

271
00:11:36,080 --> 00:11:36,920
Captain!

272
00:11:36,920 --> 00:11:38,630
Hyuga-san!

273
00:11:38,630 --> 00:11:41,810
Captain, you're a forward. You don't need to defend!

274
00:11:41,810 --> 00:11:44,010
He's right. We'll defend here.

275
00:11:44,010 --> 00:11:46,370
Don't you trust us?

276
00:11:46,370 --> 00:11:47,500
That's not it.

277
00:11:47,500 --> 00:11:48,470
Then why?

278
00:11:48,470 --> 00:11:50,440
It's true that I'm a forward.

279
00:11:50,440 --> 00:11:53,440
But before that, I'm a member of Toho.

280
00:11:53,440 --> 00:11:56,520
Nankatsu has gained momentum for attacking right now.

281
00:11:56,520 --> 00:12:00,650
And now, the mainstay of our defense, Wakashimazu, has an injured left arm.

282
00:12:00,650 --> 00:12:03,560
In this situation, being a forward or defender is irrelevant.

283
00:12:03,560 --> 00:12:05,420
Let me defend!

284
00:12:05,420 --> 00:12:07,580
Let's all defend together!

285
00:12:07,580 --> 00:12:08,700
Hyuga-san!

286
00:12:08,700 --> 00:12:10,330
I understand, Captain!

287
00:12:11,740 --> 00:12:12,830
Teamwork.

288
00:12:13,510 --> 00:12:19,050
Right now, I can feel the teamwork from Toho that I saw in Furano.

289
00:12:19,050 --> 00:12:20,840
A feeling of teamwork?

290
00:12:20,840 --> 00:12:23,060
Yes, faint, but it's there.

291
00:12:23,060 --> 00:12:26,000
To me, Toho seems united.

292
00:12:26,600 --> 00:12:28,180
Hyuga-kun...

293
00:12:28,180 --> 00:12:30,510
Somehow, Hyuga-kun seems better compared to the times

294
00:12:30,510 --> 00:12:32,850
I fought against him.

295
00:12:33,420 --> 00:12:36,230
It's not just about his weapon, the Tiger Shot.

296
00:12:33,420 --> 00:12:36,230
Tiger Shot

297
00:12:36,230 --> 00:12:40,360
There's something else about him and his way of thinking...

298
00:12:40,750 --> 00:12:42,360
I won't lose, Tsubasa.

299
00:12:49,700 --> 00:12:54,710
~Anime Lovers~
Instagram: AnimeSeverlerrr

300
00:12:57,920 --> 00:13:00,420
Nankatsu has a big chance.

301
00:13:00,420 --> 00:13:03,090
Will they turn the corner kick into a goal?

302
00:13:03,090 --> 00:13:04,050
Here we go!

303
00:13:04,050 --> 00:13:06,970
Taki-kun sends the ball directly in front of the goal!

304
00:13:09,180 --> 00:13:13,480
Before it can get there, Hyuga-kun jumps and clears the ball!

305
00:13:14,730 --> 00:13:15,550
Go!

306
00:13:15,550 --> 00:13:17,330
Now it's our turn to attack!

307
00:13:17,330 --> 00:13:19,610
Run for the ball, everyone!

308
00:13:19,610 --> 00:13:20,650
Okay!

309
00:13:20,650 --> 00:13:23,650
The game has shifted, and now Toho is attacking!

310
00:13:23,650 --> 00:13:25,350
Don't lose to them, get back!

311
00:13:25,350 --> 00:13:26,820
Nankatsu is falling back together!

312
00:13:27,990 --> 00:13:29,620
Nakazato-kun holds the ball.

313
00:13:29,620 --> 00:13:31,370
Sorimachi-kun also gets it!

314
00:13:31,870 --> 00:13:33,330
A quick opportunity for Toho.

315
00:13:33,330 --> 00:13:35,120
Will he send it to Hyuga-kun?

316
00:13:35,600 --> 00:13:38,040
But Tsubasa-kun is marking him fiercely!

317
00:13:38,040 --> 00:13:39,050
How?

318
00:13:39,050 --> 00:13:40,800
How can you play at full power?

319
00:13:40,800 --> 00:13:42,960
You were heavily injured in the first half!

320
00:13:42,960 --> 00:13:46,090
I absolutely cannot afford to lose!

321
00:13:46,090 --> 00:13:49,600
Both Tsubasa-kun and Hyuga-kun refuse to give up!

322
00:13:49,600 --> 00:13:52,990
As if he's completely recovered,

323
00:13:52,990 --> 00:13:55,850
but it's thanks to the medicine that he doesn't feel the pain.

324
00:13:55,850 --> 00:13:59,610
In reality, every time he plays, with every move he makes,

325
00:13:59,610 --> 00:14:03,360
even if he doesn't feel it, he's worsening his injury a little more.

326
00:14:03,770 --> 00:14:04,360
Damn it!

327
00:14:04,360 --> 00:14:06,150
I can't send it to the captain.

328
00:14:06,150 --> 00:14:07,390
I don't care, Sorimachi!

329
00:14:07,390 --> 00:14:08,490
Send it to me!

330
00:14:08,490 --> 00:14:09,370
Captain!

331
00:14:09,850 --> 00:14:10,490
Here!

332
00:14:10,490 --> 00:14:12,490
Sorimachi-kun sends it to Hyuga-kun.

333
00:14:12,980 --> 00:14:14,040
A high ball!

334
00:14:15,450 --> 00:14:17,000
An aerial confrontation!

335
00:14:17,950 --> 00:14:19,460
They're equal!

336
00:14:19,460 --> 00:14:21,840
Tsubasa, you can jump this high...

337
00:14:22,880 --> 00:14:23,500
Take it!

338
00:14:23,930 --> 00:14:26,510
Ishizaki-kun clears the ball!

339
00:14:26,510 --> 00:14:28,890
Nankatsu is defending well in the second half!

340
00:14:28,890 --> 00:14:31,480
Tsubasa covers every point on the field.

341
00:14:31,480 --> 00:14:32,050
Yes.

342
00:14:32,050 --> 00:14:34,810
Tsubasa is truly Nankatsu's keystone, you know.

343
00:14:35,960 --> 00:14:38,810
What is the limit of your body?

344
00:14:38,810 --> 00:14:42,310
I can't even see your power, Tsubasa Ozora!

345
00:14:42,310 --> 00:14:45,190
However, today I will defeat you!

346
00:14:45,600 --> 00:14:50,200
Tsubasa-kun, you must really be in pain, but do your best.

347
00:14:50,200 --> 00:14:52,580
There are intense changes on both sides.

348
00:14:52,580 --> 00:14:54,790
Nankatsu's turn to attack!

349
00:14:55,750 --> 00:14:58,870
Hyuga-kun is marking Tsubasa-kun!

350
00:15:00,920 --> 00:15:02,420
Izawa-kun passed to Iwami-kun.

351
00:15:03,010 --> 00:15:05,170
Sawada-kun reads his pass!

352
00:15:05,630 --> 00:15:06,170
What?!

353
00:15:06,170 --> 00:15:08,300
Toho got the ball again.

354
00:15:08,300 --> 00:15:11,800
He might not stand out too much, but Sawada is truly Toho's key player.

355
00:15:11,800 --> 00:15:16,180
The Toho attacks that start with his effort are the most fearsome ones.

356
00:15:16,180 --> 00:15:19,230
I'll send the ball to Hyuga-san as much as possible in the match.

357
00:15:19,630 --> 00:15:24,400
It's not just our coach's order, it's the will of the Toho eleven!

358
00:15:24,680 --> 00:15:26,010
Captain Hyuga!

359
00:15:26,010 --> 00:15:28,780
Toho sent the ball to Hyuga-kun once more!

360
00:15:28,780 --> 00:15:32,070
But Tsubasa-kun is marking him!

361
00:15:32,070 --> 00:15:33,430
I can't lose!

362
00:15:33,430 --> 00:15:36,030
For the sake of everyone who keeps sending the ball to me,

363
00:15:36,030 --> 00:15:38,620
I can never lose!

364
00:15:39,870 --> 00:15:42,750
Both of them jump for the ball once more!

365
00:15:42,750 --> 00:15:44,710
Win this time, big brother!

366
00:15:45,130 --> 00:15:47,300
Once again, their battle seems equal!

367
00:15:47,300 --> 00:15:48,050
Captain!

368
00:15:48,050 --> 00:15:48,800
Tsubasa!

369
00:15:51,730 --> 00:15:52,760
No, it's not!

370
00:15:54,220 --> 00:15:55,050
Tsubasa!

371
00:15:55,050 --> 00:15:56,260
I caught it!

372
00:15:56,680 --> 00:15:57,350
Damn it!

373
00:15:58,140 --> 00:16:01,100
Tiger Shot!

374
00:15:58,140 --> 00:16:01,100
Tiger Shot

375
00:16:02,140 --> 00:16:06,610
Oh my! The Tiger Shot grazes Tsubasa-kun's left shoulder!

376
00:16:02,140 --> 00:16:06,610
Tiger Shot

377
00:16:06,610 --> 00:16:08,480
It flies directly to the goal!

378
00:16:08,480 --> 00:16:11,700
But Morisaki makes a solid save!

379
00:16:15,200 --> 00:16:15,820
Tsubasa!

380
00:16:15,820 --> 00:16:16,700
Tsubasa-kun!

381
00:16:16,700 --> 00:16:17,490
Tsubasa!

382
00:16:17,490 --> 00:16:18,950
Tsubasa!

383
00:16:18,950 --> 00:16:20,120
Tsubasa!

384
00:16:20,120 --> 00:16:21,910
Is Tsubasa-kun okay?

385
00:16:21,910 --> 00:16:24,040
His shoulder was already injured.

386
00:16:24,040 --> 00:16:27,590
Moreover, the Tiger Shot passed right by it.

387
00:16:24,040 --> 00:16:27,590
Tiger Shot

388
00:16:27,590 --> 00:16:30,990
The Tiger Shot is powerful enough to burst the ball when it hits the post.

389
00:16:27,590 --> 00:16:30,990
Tiger Shot

390
00:16:30,990 --> 00:16:33,810
If its power is that weakened, then...

391
00:16:33,810 --> 00:16:36,510
Tsubasa's shoulder took the brunt of its energy directly.

392
00:16:36,510 --> 00:16:38,340
If I faint on the field this time...

393
00:16:38,340 --> 00:16:42,310
The doctor will pull me from the match.

394
00:16:44,900 --> 00:16:47,730
Tsubasa-kun quickly gets up.

395
00:16:50,110 --> 00:16:51,690
Tsubasa...

396
00:16:52,490 --> 00:16:53,780
Are you okay?

397
00:16:53,780 --> 00:16:55,450
Yes, of course.

398
00:16:55,450 --> 00:16:57,320
Tsubasa...

399
00:16:57,320 --> 00:16:59,320
Are you okay, Tsubasa?

400
00:16:59,320 --> 00:17:00,600
Yes.

401
00:17:02,820 --> 00:17:05,040
Our dream...

402
00:17:05,040 --> 00:17:08,610
To win the 3rd national championship.

403
00:17:08,610 --> 00:17:09,800
Tsubasa...

404
00:17:12,840 --> 00:17:14,960
Let's go, everyone.

405
00:17:17,300 --> 00:17:18,930
Alright, we're attacking this time, everyone!

406
00:17:18,930 --> 00:17:20,930
We're heading towards our dream!

407
00:17:20,930 --> 00:17:23,560
Now it's Nankatsu's attack!

408
00:17:23,560 --> 00:17:25,140
Tsubasa-kun...

409
00:17:25,140 --> 00:17:29,250
Tsubasa, how far does your stupidity go?

410
00:17:29,250 --> 00:17:31,650
How stupid are you when it comes to football?

411
00:17:31,650 --> 00:17:33,150
Damn it, Tsubasa!

412
00:17:33,150 --> 00:17:35,150
I won't hold back no matter what!

413
00:17:35,150 --> 00:17:36,860
I'll show you no mercy!

414
00:17:36,860 --> 00:17:38,600
I'll crush you!

415
00:17:38,600 --> 00:17:40,550
If you stand in my way once more,

416
00:17:40,550 --> 00:17:43,030
I'll make sure you eat my Tiger Shot to the face!

417
00:17:40,550 --> 00:17:43,030
Tiger Shot

418
00:17:43,030 --> 00:17:45,750
Of course! It couldn't be any other way, Hyuga-kun!

419
00:17:45,750 --> 00:17:46,790
Hah!

420
00:17:46,790 --> 00:17:47,880
Stop them, everyone!

421
00:17:47,880 --> 00:17:49,880
Don't let him shoot at the goal!

422
00:17:50,410 --> 00:17:51,050
Izawa!

423
00:17:52,010 --> 00:17:55,470
Yes, becoming three-time national champions is our dream!

424
00:17:55,470 --> 00:17:58,800
Come on, let's make this dream a reality together, Tsubasa.

425
00:17:58,800 --> 00:17:59,680
I'm coming!

426
00:17:59,680 --> 00:18:02,010
I can't lose to a first-year student again!

427
00:18:03,350 --> 00:18:06,350
Izawa-kun pretended to dribble forward, but instead sends a back pass.

428
00:18:07,560 --> 00:18:09,480
We'll make our dreams come true!

429
00:18:09,480 --> 00:18:10,190
Take this!

430
00:18:12,510 --> 00:18:15,240
A perfect combination play from Nankatsu!

431
00:18:15,240 --> 00:18:18,840
The final official game of our third year!

432
00:18:18,840 --> 00:18:19,370
Here!

433
00:18:19,370 --> 00:18:22,980
We'll graduate undefeated for three years!

434
00:18:22,980 --> 00:18:24,870
The ball is sent to Taki-kun!

435
00:18:24,870 --> 00:18:27,640
Everyone who has fought alongside me for three years,

436
00:18:27,640 --> 00:18:30,210
let's win this final match and make it meaningful!

437
00:18:30,210 --> 00:18:32,170
"National 3-time Champions."

438
00:18:32,170 --> 00:18:35,210
Let's make our dreams a reality!

439
00:18:36,750 --> 00:18:38,930
Taki-kun crosses into the penalty area!

440
00:18:40,420 --> 00:18:42,720
Nagano-kun headed the ball away.

441
00:18:42,720 --> 00:18:44,600
Nankatsu became one whole!

442
00:18:44,600 --> 00:18:45,900
Eat this!

443
00:18:45,900 --> 00:18:49,060
Kisugi-kun finishes with a sliding shot!

444
00:18:49,060 --> 00:18:49,690
Ah!

445
00:18:50,190 --> 00:18:51,560
Great, it's in!

446
00:18:52,850 --> 00:18:54,140
Blocked!

447
00:18:54,140 --> 00:18:56,800
Even Nankatsu's fierce attack couldn't score against the tournament's

448
00:18:56,800 --> 00:18:59,110
number 1 goalkeeper, Wakashimazu-kun.

449
00:18:59,110 --> 00:19:00,760
As if I'd let you score!

450
00:19:00,760 --> 00:19:03,030
I will protect Toho's goal!

451
00:19:03,030 --> 00:19:04,700
Nice, Wakashimazu!

452
00:19:04,700 --> 00:19:07,580
Damn it, it was a perfect attack!

453
00:19:07,580 --> 00:19:09,580
The ball is still in play!

454
00:19:10,460 --> 00:19:12,210
Leave this part to me!

455
00:19:12,210 --> 00:19:13,960
Ishizaki-kun!

456
00:19:13,960 --> 00:19:17,080
Sorry, everyone, but I'm the one who's been friends with this football genius,

457
00:19:17,080 --> 00:19:20,840
Tsubasa Ozora, the longest!

458
00:19:21,350 --> 00:19:25,810
I've been hanging out with him since he moved to Nankatsu!

459
00:19:26,580 --> 00:19:29,440
Tsubasa, let's win together again!

460
00:19:29,440 --> 00:19:31,940
Would I let someone like you score a goal against me?!

461
00:19:31,940 --> 00:19:34,920
Ishizaki-kun's jumping header is ineffective!

462
00:19:34,920 --> 00:19:36,820
An impassable block from Hyuga-kun!

463
00:19:36,820 --> 00:19:37,690
Captain!

464
00:19:37,690 --> 00:19:39,190
Nice, Hyuga-san!

465
00:19:40,790 --> 00:19:44,370
Ishizaki-kun turned, got the ball, and threw an overhead back pass!

466
00:19:44,370 --> 00:19:45,200
What?!

467
00:19:46,950 --> 00:19:47,700
Ahh, that hurts!

468
00:19:47,700 --> 00:19:50,000
Ishizaki-kun and everyone...

469
00:19:51,650 --> 00:19:53,430
Tsubasa-kun jumped!

470
00:19:58,160 --> 00:19:59,280
It's in!

471
00:19:59,280 --> 00:20:01,590
An aerial dive from Tsubasa-kun!

472
00:20:03,270 --> 00:20:04,600
It's in!

473
00:20:05,270 --> 00:20:07,100
It's a tie!

474
00:20:07,100 --> 00:20:08,600
You did it, Tsubasa!

475
00:20:08,600 --> 00:20:09,560
Tsubasa!

476
00:20:09,560 --> 00:20:10,600
Nice shot!

477
00:20:11,030 --> 00:20:12,830
Great teamwork from Nankatsu!

478
00:20:12,830 --> 00:20:16,360
Finishing the attack was Nankatsu's Captain, Ozora Tsubasa-kun!

479
00:20:17,090 --> 00:20:20,860
A desperate aerial dive straight into the goal!

480
00:20:20,860 --> 00:20:23,650
It's 10 minutes into the second half, and the champion Nankatsu

481
00:20:23,650 --> 00:20:26,870
has finally caught up to a 3-3 score!

482
00:20:26,870 --> 00:20:28,570
Nankatsu's hidden power.

483
00:20:28,570 --> 00:20:30,330
Tsubasa's hidden power.

484
00:20:30,330 --> 00:20:33,210
Great teamwork, Nankatsu.

485
00:20:33,210 --> 00:20:36,600
Even though he's battered and injured,

486
00:20:36,600 --> 00:20:41,130
Tsubasa went and finally scored!

487
00:20:41,130 --> 00:20:43,010
It's a tie, Senpai!

488
00:20:43,560 --> 00:20:44,580
Yes.

489
00:20:45,430 --> 00:20:46,890
Thank goodness.

490
00:20:46,890 --> 00:20:48,890
Senpai...

491
00:20:48,890 --> 00:20:51,890
Tsubasa, you're a child.

492
00:20:51,890 --> 00:20:54,810
Mama-san, he did it!

493
00:20:54,810 --> 00:20:57,310
Even though they had the advantage,

494
00:20:57,310 --> 00:21:00,630
Toho Academy has now been caught up to a tie score.

495
00:21:00,630 --> 00:21:04,570
There are 20 minutes left in the match, and now they go back to square one.

496
00:21:04,570 --> 00:21:05,910
Big brother...

497
00:21:05,910 --> 00:21:07,120
Kojiro...

498
00:21:07,120 --> 00:21:08,450
Everyone...

499
00:21:08,450 --> 00:21:11,700
As you can see, Tsubasa-kun's body is full of injuries.

500
00:21:11,700 --> 00:21:16,350
On the other hand, Hyuga-kun is playing his first match in the tournament,

501
00:21:16,350 --> 00:21:19,090
and he's playing this final match in top condition.

502
00:21:19,090 --> 00:21:23,360
Even though the score is tied, we can say Toho has the advantage.

503
00:21:24,540 --> 00:21:27,390
Everyone, let's aim for the right corner when we shoot.

504
00:21:27,390 --> 00:21:28,310
Huh?

505
00:21:28,310 --> 00:21:31,460
Wakashimazu-kun's left arm seems to be injured.

506
00:21:31,460 --> 00:21:32,890
Really, Tsubasa?

507
00:21:33,730 --> 00:21:37,650
That's why he was protecting the goal by punching the ball he normally would have caught.

508
00:21:37,650 --> 00:21:40,650
Tsubasa, you...

509
00:21:40,650 --> 00:21:44,070
Did you really calmly observe that during the game?

510
00:21:44,070 --> 00:21:48,240
I just became familiar with injuries.

511
00:21:48,240 --> 00:21:49,780
Tsubasa...

512
00:21:50,370 --> 00:21:52,370
If I keep getting injured like this,

513
00:21:52,370 --> 00:21:56,920
I might not be able to become a professional football player like Roberto.

514
00:21:57,360 --> 00:21:58,420
Still...

515
00:21:58,420 --> 00:22:00,920
I will definitely win this match.

516
00:22:00,920 --> 00:22:02,480
I can't lose.

517
00:22:02,480 --> 00:22:04,330
I'll show Roberto.

518
00:22:04,330 --> 00:22:07,440
I'll show him my record, the mark I left in Japan;

519
00:22:07,440 --> 00:22:10,760
the reign of three consecutive national championships!

520
00:22:11,240 --> 00:22:15,010
Then I'll overcome these injuries and go to Brazil, the home of football.

521
00:22:15,010 --> 00:22:18,280
I'll challenge your country, Roberto!

522
00:22:19,750 --> 00:22:35,000
